sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as vllm-orchestrator-gateway<br/>8090/TCP HTTP
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails Orchestrator<br/>8085/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Detectors as Detector Services<br/>(e.g., regex-detector)
    participant vLLM as vLLM Inference Server

    Note over Client,vLLM: Flow 1: Non-Streaming Chat Completion with Detection

    Client->>Gateway: POST /{route}/v1/chat/completions<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>Authorization: Bearer Token<br/>stream: false
    Note over Gateway: Lookup route config from config.yaml<br/>Inject input/output detector<br/>configuration into payload
    Gateway->>Orchestrator: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>Authorization: forwarded<br/>X-Forwarded-*: forwarded<br/>(optional mTLS client cert)
    Orchestrator->>Detectors: Run input detectors<br/>(e.g., PII scan on prompt)
    Detectors-->>Orchestrator: Detection results
    Orchestrator->>vLLM: Chat completion request
    vLLM-->>Orchestrator: Generated response
    Orchestrator->>Detectors: Run output detectors<br/>(e.g., PII scan on response)
    Detectors-->>Orchestrator: Detection results
    Orchestrator-->>Gateway: Full response with detection metadata
    alt No detections found
        Gateway-->>Client: Original response<br/>Content-Type: application/json
    else Detections found & fallback configured
        Note over Gateway: Replace response content<br/>with fallback_message
        Gateway-->>Client: Fallback response<br/>Content-Type: application/json
    end

    Note over Client,vLLM: Flow 2: Streaming Chat Completion with Detection

    Client->>Gateway: POST /{route}/v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer Token<br/>stream: true
    Note over Gateway: Inject detector config into payload
    Gateway->>Orchestrator: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>(optional mTLS)
    Orchestrator->>vLLM: Streaming chat completion
    loop SSE Stream Chunks
        vLLM-->>Orchestrator: SSE chunk (delta content)
        Orchestrator->>Detectors: Check chunk for detections
        Detectors-->>Orchestrator: Detection result
        Orchestrator-->>Gateway: SSE chunk with detection metadata
        alt No detection in chunk
            Gateway-->>Client: SSE chunk (original content)
        else Detection found in chunk
            Note over Gateway: Replace chunk content<br/>with fallback_message<br/>Set finish_reason: "stop"
            Gateway-->>Client: SSE chunk (fallback message)
            Note over Client: Stream terminated<br/>Partial earlier content<br/>already delivered
        end
    end
